  <section class="individual bg-darkblue pb-3 pt-5">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="row">
        <div class="col-sm-12">
          <div class="title-container">
            <img src="https://individualogist.com/soul-flame-tarot/assets/img/title-bg-v2.png" alt="Snow" style="width:100%;">
            <h3 class="centered"><span class="username">Chamilka</span>, You Are The <span class="archetype">Jester</span> - <span class="text-orange">And This Is What It Means...</span></h3>
          </div>
          <div class="row">
            <div class="col-sm-4 order-sm-2">
              <img src="../assets/images/it-means.png" style="width: 100%;">
            </div>
            <div class="col-sm-8">
              <p>Before you dismiss this Archetypal Introduction as nothing but hogwash, you must know that the Jester archetype is NOT one that's solely represented as a mere joker.</p>
              <p>Truth be told, there's so much more about the Jester archetype. As we progress through this Archetypal Introduction, you'll begin to understand what I mean. But before we proceed, please do so with with an open mind, and a willing heart.</p>
              <p>The Jester archetype is blessed with <span class="text-orange">astute, sharp, and quick-witted</span>. That means that you are an individual who is able to approach a variety of topics from a myriad of perspectives. Despite your playful appearance and mischievous behavior, you are nimble and brilliant in your own unique way.</p>
              <p>You seem to be able to breeze your way through life, with your unconventional ideas, amusing comments, and hilarious interpretations. Naturally, you're often the life of the party. People enjoy being around you, because wherever you go, good times are bound to follow!</p>
              <p>Others might perceive you to be an individual who's more emotional because of your spontaneity... But, you are in fact, more intuitive and perceptive than you make yourself out to be. After all, <span class="username"></span> , your excellent sense of humor is constructed with creativity, and seasoned with your charisma. And that requires a certain caliber of incisiveness.</p>

            </div>
          </div>
          <p>Your archetype also suggests that you're <span class="text-orange">a charismatic individual</span>... There's just something about the way you speak, the way you portray yourself, that appears hypnotic... Alluring, even.</p>
          <p>People find themselves drawn to you because of your ability to spice up your conversations. And all of that just seems to come naturally to you, doesn't it? Your personable body language and outgoing attitude towards in life makes you a sheer joy to be around.</p>
          <p>Your archetype also suggests that you're casual, easy-going, and free-spirited. You're the type of person who allows your imagination to run wild, conjuring the most ridiculous ideas and painting the silliest images in your head... An individual who simply doesn't take life too seriously.</p>
          <p>Amongst all the archetypes, yours is one of the few that's idealistic... And that's best illustrated through the innerworkings of your <span class="text-orange">unique mind and vibrant personality</span>. You tend to daydream more than you actually do, but whenever you do see your ideas to fruition, great things always seem to happen.</p>
          <p>You might not like to admit it, <span class="username"></span> ... But you tend to waiver a bit when it comes to serious situations or harsh conversations. You'd very much rather avoid such instances entirely, instead of having to actually deal with them. That is a struggle that you must be careful of. But we'll speak more to that later.</p>
          <p>The Jester archetype is such a joy to be around, and I have no doubt that your friends and loved ones will agree with this. Your light-hearted and jovial nature make you fun-loving, charismatic, and likeable.</p>
          <p>You try not to be serious most of the time, and you enjoy engaging in little things that make someone else's day brighter. Whether it's dropping one of your iconic one-liners or performing silly actions.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="individual text-left pb-3 pt-5">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="row">
        <div class="col-sm-12">
          <div class="title-container">
            <img src="https://individualogist.com/soul-flame-tarot/assets/img/title-bg-v2.png" alt="Snow" style="width:100%;" class="long-title">
            <h3 class="centered">As A <span class="archetype">Jester</span>, These Are Your <span class="text-orange">Hidden Qualities, Unknown Tendencies,<br>And Positive Attributes</span> That You Wouldn't Expect</h3>
          </div>
          <div class="row">
            <div class="col-sm-4">
              <img src="../assets/images/abilities.png" style="width: 100%;">
            </div>
            <div class="col-sm-8">
              <p>The quality most common among Jesters is the fact that you are quite extroverted. You tend to love being around people and you likewise love absorbing and giving them back the same energy and vigor you would expect from one another.</p>
              <p>Typically, you manifest your extroversion by being funny, happy and free. As the name implies, you are truly the joker-- witty and full of jokes, you bring life to any party and laughs to any room.</p>
              <p>Being that you are a lively person, it is only natural that you are we-centric. This means that you have the ability to cooperate with other people and <span class="text-orange">fill them with optimism</span>. You have the right mindset when it comes to other people because you help improve their own through your actions. However, the fact that you can do this in excess means that there is also a need to be careful on your part. Sometimes, straining yourself for others just isn’t worth the trouble.</p>
              <p>As a Jester, you tend to be more intuitive about your thought process. You like giving things the optimistic benefit of the doubt, and you are also highly spiritual and attuned to emotion. You think with your heart, and while there are times when this doesn’t work, life nevertheless rewards you for it because it makes you a better person through it all.</p>

            </div>
          </div>
          <p>Additionally, Turbulence is also one of your defining traits as a Jester. Your emotions tend to run wild, and you generally operate under the context of mood. Consequently, you are more <span class="text-orange">passionate, lively, and active</span>. However, despite this gift, you can also become difficult to convince at times, and even anxious about the future, considering that negative emotions can bubble up at moments prior to making an impactful and long-lasting decision.</p>
          <p>That being said, there’s more about your potential than you understand at this juncture, <span class="username"></span>. </p>
          <p>With your hidden qualities in full view, it is time for you to know what your strengths are and how you can better use them...</p>
        </div>
        <div class="col-sm-12 text-center">
          <a class="btn btn-outline-success btn-1" id="nav-btn2" onclick="nextReading(1,2)">Show Me Now</a>
        </div>
