  </section>

  <section class="individual bg-darkblue pb-3 pt-5" id="step4">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="row">
        <div class="col-sm-12">
          <div class="title-container">
            <img src="https://individualogist.com/soul-flame-tarot/assets/img/title-bg-v2.png" alt="Snow" style="width:100%;">
            <h3 class="centered">As A <span class="archetype">Jester</span>, These Are Your <span class="text-orange">Potential Career Paths</span></h3>
          </div>
          <p>Generally, the Jester is a combination of extroversion, intuitiveness, we-centeredness, and turbulence. This makes up for strong career paths in relation to arts, entertainment, and people management. With their altruistic nature, Jesters can blossom in these paths. And while these are suggestive of what you can pursue with your strengths, know that you should never limit yourself to them.</p>
          <div class="row" style="margin-top: 3em;">
            <div class="col-sm-4 order-sm-2">
              <img src="../assets/images/entertainer.png" style="width: 100%;">
            </div>
            <div class="col-sm-8">
              <h5>Entertainers/Liberal Arts</h5>
              <p>With their uniqueness, Jesters are best suited as entertainers. Because they have the natural knack to crack jokes left and right, they’ll find it natural to become an entertainer.</p>
              <p>As a Jester, your gift is to bring joy and happiness to others. And what better way to do this apart from being an entertainer yourself? Able to engage with your audience in a whole new level, you can limitlessly define the definition of being an entertainer.</p>
              <p>On the onset, one would usually associate Jesters as clowns or modern-day stand-up comedians. While these perfectly suit the Jester’s role, the definition of becoming an entertainer here actually goes beyond that.</p>
              <p>For instance, binge-worthy dramas are often played by good actors and actresses. But behind the scenes, the scriptwriter is the one who’s truly entertaining the audience. By doing their craft through writing, the limitless imagination of the scriptwriter gives life to the story that’s being portrayed. While we perceive entertainers as famous celebrities, they can also be lowkey playmakers such as scriptwriters or even production staff.</p>

            </div>
          </div>
          <p>Moreover, being an entertainer can also mean playing music, doing arts, writing blogs, or even becoming event organizers. As long as you can find your own stride, you are able to define entertainment in any way possible. Thus, make sure that when you pursue this path, be clear on your why and how for being an entertainer is never really limited on what we usually define it to be.</p>

          <div class="row" style="margin-top: 3em;">
            <div class="col-sm-4 order-sm-2">
              <img src="../assets/images/humanitarian.png" style="width: 100%;">
            </div>
            <div class="col-sm-8">
              <h5>Humanitarians/Social Workers</h5>
              <p>Jesters are underrated humanitarians. This is because when we speak of altruistic jobs, what often comes to mind are the Caregivers. While the latter archetype is truly the best in this field, Jesters can also excel in this area.</p>
              <p>For one, the Jester is a combination of extroversion and we-centeredness. Because of these traits, Jesters can provide that much-needed warmth and personal touch that other archetypes sometimes neglect.</p>
              <p>As such, working in Non-profit or Non-government Organizations are great opportunities for Jesters to display their ability to reach towards their neighbor. And this doesn’t simply mean giving dole-outs and scholarships impersonally.</p>
              <p>Instead, the way you manifest being a Jester is something more personal and touching. Since you see life in its minuscule appearance, you know the importance of delving in the moment itself. Because of this, you are never hesitant to reach-out and be there with those that need you.</p>

            </div>
          </div>
          <p>For instance, you are the type who’s willing to go to the margins and even live with the poor. Because charity isn’t simply handing out cash bonds, you’ll immerse yourself in their own reality and truly dedicate your time, talents, and treasures for them.</p>
          <p>As a consequence, this career path allows you to live out your gift of bringing joy and happiness to others. More than becoming an internet icon, this career path will allow you to experience life’s fragility and beauty, a paradox that you understand better than anyone else.</p>
          <div class="row" style="margin-top: 3em;">
            <div class="col-sm-4 order-sm-2">
              <img src="../assets/images/counselor.png" style="width: 100%;">
            </div>
            <div class="col-sm-8">
              <h5>Counselors/Psychologists</h5>
              <p>Unbeknownst to many, Jesters are actually great in the field of human psychology. Since they are naturally people-oriented and extroverts, they often get a good grasp of those around them. Intuitively, they can sense one’s mood and perceive their perspectives. With these skillsets, you can live out your goal of bringing joy and happiness to others.</p>
              <p>If you look at it, processing the nature of human life is nothing new to you. After all, your unique perspectives constantly allow you to see the paradoxes of life as it ebbs and flows. With happiness and despair as both ends of the same spectrum, you understand the struggles of being human.</p>
              <p>Meaning, you are second to the Sage in knowing what it means to live. Just as the ancient philosophers raised these questions on one’s meaning and existence, you constantly battle these thoughts deep within you. Often, you channel them through arts and comedy, turning torment into entertainment.</p>

            </div>
          </div>
          <p>More importantly, you can also utilize these realizations to help others cope with their struggles. As counselors and/or psychologists, Jesters can use their wisdom and altruistic nature to guide their patients. Wielding the power of an intuitive understanding of life’s inner workings, Jesters can reveal one’s inner thoughts and process them.</p>
          <p>And when they do, Jesters can impact their society beyond entertainment. Being a Jester yourself, wouldn’t it be nice to have that power to help shape other’s futures?</p>
          <p>But while your career prospects certainly glimmer with the hope of prosperity, there are uncomfortable truths about yourself that you will need to face. The first of which will be no more comforting, <span class="username"></span>, and it is this...</p>
        </div>
        <div class="col-sm-12 text-center">
